    "seed_note": "Seeds are chosen only to fix identities and destinations: actor = spiffe://example/agent/workspace/(seed % 13), principal = did:example:user:(seed % 97), customer N = seed % 10000. 1001 and 1014 (=0 mod 13) -> actor agent-B; 1002 (=1 mod 13) -> actor agent-A; 89999 and 2002 (=0 mod 13) -> actor agent-B, and 89999 (=9999 mod 10000) makes the original UNTRUSTED_FIELD_BINDING proposal resolve to the attacker destination, so a hypothetical effect would be visibly unauthorized."
